    or damage arising from your use of the Site or from reliance on anything it
    shows. That expressly includes the cost of travel bookings, cancellation or
    rescheduling charges, forfeited leave, lost pay, missed events, or any indirect or
    consequential loss.
  </p>
  <p>
    The Site is free and operated by one individual. If any liability cannot lawfully
    be excluded, it is limited to the amount you paid to use the Site, which is zero.
    Nothing in these terms limits liability for fraud, or for anything else that
    cannot be limited under Indian law.
  </p>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>
    Use the Site for planning your own leave, or your team's. Please do not:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      attempt to disrupt or overload it, or probe it for vulnerabilities, or interfere
      with anyone else's use of it;
    </li>
    <li>
      scrape it at a volume that degrades service for others — the underlying holiday
