    not responsible for their content, availability or their own terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Your own files</h2>
  <p>
    The <a href="/company-optimizer">office holiday optimizer</a> processes files
    entirely within your browser; nothing is uploaded to us. You remain responsible
    for whether you are permitted to use a given document — if your company's holiday
    circular is confidential, that stays between you and your employer. Because the
    file never leaves your device, we cannot access it, store it or return it.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may revise these terms. The date at the top of this page records when they
